<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7904-3892"><rdf:type rdf:resource="https://schema.org/Person"></rdf:type><schema:affiliation xmlns:schema="https://schema.org/">Digital Humanities (Image/Object), Friedrich-Schiller-University Jena</schema:affiliation><schema:affiliation xmlns:schema="https://schema.org/">Research Center DIGITAL ORGANOLOGY, Leipzig University</schema:affiliation><schema:name xmlns:schema="https://schema.org/">Dominik Ukolov</schema:name></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ApplicabilityScope"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A resource stating whether and under which communities, places, periods, uses, techniques, configurations, languages, or times an assertion applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applicability scope</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#AuthorityAssignment"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A time-bounded mandate connecting an agent to roles, subject matter, communities, and validation dimensions.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">authority assignment</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationAssertion"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An occurrence-level claim that a named target is classified by a concept under a recorded perspective, scope, method, and provenance.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">classification assertion</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationAssignment"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The provenance-bearing activity that applies a named classification to a target and generates a distinct classification assertion entity.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">classification assignment</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E17_Type_Assignment"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"></rdfs:subClassOf><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ConceptRelationAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#LabelAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#NoteAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewDecision"></owl:disjointWith></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationCriterion"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A governed description of an observable organological basis and any documented inference logic used by an assignment.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">classification criterion</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationExpression"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An ordered compound classification expression whose component targets and suffix scope are explicit or explicitly unresolved.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">classification expression</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationExpressionMember"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">One ordered member of a compound classification expression.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">classification expression member</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ConceptRelationAssertion"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A qualified structural relation or purpose-specific mapping claim between two concepts.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">concept relation assertion</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ConditionState"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A time-bounded condition of an object or component, kept distinct from the configuration it was intended to have.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">condition state</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#Evidence"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A structured citation, resource, or note directionally related to an assertion, observation, criterion, or review decision.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">evidence record</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#FunctionalModule"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A functional subsystem or configurable module participating in sound production or control.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">functional module</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#InstrumentComponent"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A physical component that can be observed or classified without propagating its class to the whole object.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">instrument component</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#InstrumentConfiguration"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A time-bounded arrangement of an object, components, modules, accessories, or signal path that may receive its own classification.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">instrument configuration</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#LabelAssertion"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A contextualized assertion that assigns a lexical label to a concept.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">label assertion</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#LabelProfile"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A conservative linguistic and display profile attached to one assertion-scoped label resource.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">label linguistic profile</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#NoteAssertion"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A contextualized assertion that assigns a definition or other SKOS note to a concept.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">note assertion</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ObservationAssessment"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A record of whether an organological property was observed or applicable; it is not itself an observation activity when the status is non-observation or non-applicability.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">observation assessment</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ObservationResult"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A categorical, literal, quantity, or range result of an organological observation.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">observation result</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalObservation"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An observation or measurement of a target or part, recording property, result, procedure, observer, and time before classification inference.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">organological observation</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crmsci/S27_Observation"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation"></rdfs:subClassOf><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ObservationAssessment"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A target whose physical identity, component structure, configuration, state, sounding realization, or performance role may be described independently.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">organological target</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#Perspective"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An explicit source, institutional, scholarly, community, curatorial, historical, or technical standpoint from which an assertion is made or evaluated.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">named perspective</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ProjectionPolicy"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A versioned rule set governing which qualified assertions may appear in a named graph or simplified direct view.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">projection policy</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ProtocolApplication"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The application of an authoritative cultural or community protocol to specified resources, separate from legal rights and epistemic review.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">protocol application</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#QualityFinding"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An occurrence of a quality rule against a target assertion, retained as a review signal.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">quality finding</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#QualityRule"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A deterministic validation or review-signal rule that has no human review effect by itself.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">quality rule</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewDecision"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">The durable outcome entity generated by a review event; lifecycle links apply to decisions rather than to the activities that created them.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">review decision</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewEvent"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A provenance-bearing review activity that evaluates an assertion and generates a distinct review decision.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">review event</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"></rdfs:subClassOf><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ClassificationAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ConceptRelationAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#LabelAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#NoteAssertion"></owl:disjointWith><owl:disjointWith xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewDecision"></owl:disjointWith></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewRequirement"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A minimum reviewer-authority, validation-dimension, outcome, and independence condition used by a projection policy.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">review requirement</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#ReviewStatus"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A controlled lifecycle status used for assertions without collapsing separate review decisions.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">review status</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#SoundingRealization"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A particular occurrence or configuration of sounding, distinct from a physical artefact realization in other music ontologies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">sounding realization</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#OrganologicalTarget"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#UseDecision"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">An action-, purpose-, audience-, and time-specific authorization decision governing publication or reuse.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">use decision</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"></rdfs:subClassOf></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#VetoRule"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">A policy rule identifying active review decisions that prevent an assertion from entering a projection.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">review veto rule</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#actualPlayingTechnique"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a playing technique observed in an actual sounding realization or performance.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">actual playing technique</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliedBy"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies the agent that recorded or applied a protocol to the target resources.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applied by</rdfs:label><rdfs:range xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"></rdfs:range></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToCommunity"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a community for which the described scope or label profile applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to community</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToInstrumentConfiguration"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies an instrument configuration for which an assertion applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to instrument configuration</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToLanguageVariety"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a language variety for which an assertion applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to language variety</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToPeriod"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a historical or cultural period for which the described scope applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to period</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToPlace"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a place for which the described scope or label profile applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to place</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToPlayingTechnique"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a playing technique for which an assertion applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to playing technique</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#appliesToUsageDomain"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies a usage domain for which the described scope or label profile applies.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">applies to usage domain</rdfs:label></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#assertionOrigin"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">States whether a record is source-asserted, source-derived, or locally authored.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">assertion origin</rdfs:label><rdfs:range xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"></rdfs:range></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#assessmentAgent"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies the agent responsible for an observation assessment record.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">assessment agent</rdfs:label><rdfs:range xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"></rdfs:range></rdf:Description><rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro#assessmentFeatureOfInterest"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property"></rdf:type><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></rdf:type><rdfs:comment xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Identifies the target considered by an observation assessment without claiming that an observation occurred.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:isDefinedBy xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/modavis/omaro/ontology"></rdfs:isDefinedBy><rdfs:label xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">assessment feature of interest</rdfs:label></rdf:De